#
# CQ8 (INHABITED-COMPETENCY.md, INHABITED-TOPOLOGY.md): under co-tenancy, WHO was
# driving the shared host at T is answered from the recorded
# gmeow:ControlAssessments — each co-tenant's attributed gmeow:controlLevel is
# addressable and a solver ranks them over these facts, never over a privileged
# gmeow:primaryInhabitant (Principles 9, 12; there is no such term, pinned by
# tests/structural.ttl). Control is causal driving, distinct from the deception
# slice's held-vs-projected standpoint divergence (belief-vs-presentation), which
# does NOT answer control and is deliberately absent from this projection.
PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
SELECT ?agent ?level WHERE {
    ?ca a gmeow:ControlAssessment ;
        gmeow:controlAgent ?agent ;
        gmeow:controlLevel ?level .
}
ORDER BY ?agent
